<title>UK: Cie Bancaire sets 200 mln euro bond. [corrected 10:03 gmt]</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sets 200 mln euro bond. [corrected 10:03 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE BANCAIRE</p>
<p> AMT ** 200 MLN EURO  COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    09.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.495   PAY DATE    09.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.97     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price from 100.495 to 101.495).</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL START OF THE THIRD STAGE OF MONETARY UNION,</p>
<p>		ALL MONETARY RIGHTS AND OBLIGATIONS SHALL BE IN ECU</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
